a number called 'the crate hex sum' is 'the inbox hex value' add 0xc661c295982b62e.
If 'the crate hex sum' is not 893432540000597638 then, Print "ASSERT EXP-14: expected 893432540000597638 got {'the crate hex sum'}", Exit 95. Print 'the crate hex sum'.

--- the same leaf, nested ---
  a number called 'the inbox hex value' is 0x58,
  If 'the inbox hex value' is not 88 then, Print "ASSERT EXP-05: expected 88 got {'the inbox hex value'}", Exit 95. Print 'the inbox hex value',
  a number called 'the crate hex sum' is 'the inbox hex value' add 0xc661c295982b62e,
  If 'the crate hex sum' is not 893432540000597638 then, Print "ASSERT EXP-14: expected 893432540000597638 got {'the crate hex sum'}", Exit 95. Print 'the crate hex sum'.

