--- EXP-46: not <condition>, the raw comparison holds (not-branch must not fire) ---
a number called 'cupboard left reading' is 7241.
a number called 'workbench right reading' is 0.
If not 'cupboard left reading' is greater than 'workbench right reading' then, Print "ASSERT EXP-46: expected the not-branch to disagree with the raw comparison", Exit 95. Otherwise, Print "EXP-46 ok".

--- the same leaf, the raw comparison does not hold (not-branch must fire) ---
a number called 'scratch left reading' is 408.
a number called 'the sketchpad right reading' is 1550.
If not 'scratch left reading' is greater than 'the sketchpad right reading' then, Print "EXP-46 ok". Otherwise, Print "ASSERT EXP-46: expected the not-branch to disagree with the raw comparison", Exit 95.

--- EXP-27, EXP-36: the optional article, arithmetic and comparison agreement ---
a number called v1 is 3591.
If the v1 add 51032 is not v1 add 51032 then, Print "ASSERT EXP-27: expected the articled and bare readings of v1 to add the same way", Exit 95. Print v1 add 51032.
a boolean called 'the postbag articled reading' is false.
If the v1 is greater than 51032 then, Set 'the postbag articled reading' to true.
a boolean called 'the postbag bare reading' is false.
If v1 is greater than 51032 then, Set 'the postbag bare reading' to true.
If 'the postbag articled reading' is not 'the postbag bare reading' then, Print "ASSERT EXP-36: expected the articled and bare readings of v1 to compare the same way", Exit 95. Print 'the postbag articled reading'.

--- EXP-51: plural are-form vs written-out conjunction ---
a boolean called 'the pigeonhole witness' is true.
a boolean called 'storeroom witness' is true.
a boolean called 'satchel witness' is false.
a boolean called 'the greeting witness' is false.
a boolean called 'the postbag plural result' is false.
If 'the pigeonhole witness', 'storeroom witness', 'satchel witness', and 'the greeting witness' are true then, Set 'the postbag plural result' to true.
a boolean called 'the postbag expanded result' is false.
If 'the pigeonhole witness' is true and 'storeroom witness' is true and 'satchel witness' is true and 'the greeting witness' is true then, Set 'the postbag expanded result' to true.
If 'the postbag plural result' is not 'the postbag expanded result' then, Print "ASSERT EXP-51: expected the plural are-form and the written-out conjunction to agree", Exit 95. Print 'the postbag plural result'.

--- the same leaf, a seed that draws a different subject count ---
a boolean called 'the waybill witness' is true.
a boolean called 'outgoing post witness' is true.
a boolean called 'the postbag plural result' is false.
If 'the waybill witness', and 'outgoing post witness' are true then, Set 'the postbag plural result' to true.
a boolean called 'the postbag expanded result' is false.
If 'the waybill witness' is true and 'outgoing post witness' is true then, Set 'the postbag expanded result' to true.
If 'the postbag plural result' is not 'the postbag expanded result' then, Print "ASSERT EXP-51: expected the plural are-form and the written-out conjunction to agree", Exit 95. Print 'the postbag plural result'.

