a number called 'scratch rounded reading' is {'storeroom reading' add 0.5} as a number.
If 'scratch rounded reading' is not 14 then, Print "ASSERT EXP-94: expected 14 got {'scratch rounded reading'}", Exit 95. Print 'scratch rounded reading'.

